            "ImageDescription": {
              "value": "<div class=\"description\">\n<a href=\"https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clorinda_Corradi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"es:Clorinda Corradi\">Clorinda (Adelaida) Corradi</a> interpreta el papel de <i>Norma</i> en la <a href=\"https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norma_(%C3%B3pera)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"es:Norma (\u00f3pera)\">opera hom\u00f3nima</a> de <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"commons-creator vcard\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r966088355\">\n<table class=\"commons-creator-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed mw-content-ltr\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\"><span class=\"fn\" id=\"creator\"><bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Vincenzo_Bellini\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Vincenzo Bellini\"><span title=\"Italian opera composer (1801\u20131835)\">Vincenzo Bellini</span></a></bdi></span>\u00a0(1801\u20131835)\u00a0<span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Creator:Vincenzo_Bellini\" title=\"Creator:Vincenzo Bellini\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Blue_pencil.svg/20px-Blue_pencil.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Blue_pencil.svg/40px-Blue_pencil.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"600\"></a></span>\u00a0<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q170209\" title=\"wikidata:Q170209\"><img alt=\"wikidata:Q170209\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Wikidata-logo.svg/20px-Wikidata-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Wikidata-logo.svg/40px-Wikidata-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1050\" data-file-height=\"590\"></a></span>\u00a0<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/it:Autore:Vincenzo_Bellini\" title=\"s:it:Autore:Vincenzo Bellini\"><img alt=\"s:it:Autore:Vincenzo Bellini\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Wikisource-logo.svg/20px-Wikisource-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Wikisource-logo.svg/40px-Wikisource-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"410\" data-file-height=\"430\"></a></span>\u00a0<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikiquote.org/wiki/it:Vincenzo_Bellini\" title=\"q:it:Vincenzo Bellini\"><img alt=\"q:it:Vincenzo Bellini\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/20px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/40px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"355\"></a></span> <div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-arrowtoggle skin-invert\">\u00a0</span></div></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"8\" style=\"width:120px\" id=\"fileinfotpl_creator_image\"><span class=\"wpIma